{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29196","headline":"闻开江宋相公申锡下世二首 二 · 许浑","name":"闻开江宋相公申锡下世二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月落湘潭棹不喧，玉杯瑶瑟奠苹蘩。\n谁能力制乘时鹤，自取机沈在槛猨。\n位极乾坤三事贵，谤兴华夏一夫冤。\n宵衣旰食明天子，日伏青蒲不敢言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}